# Line endings for this repo.
#
# The working tree and the repository are both LF. Nothing here needs CRLF:
# MSBuild, the C# compiler, XAML, PowerShell and Notepad all read LF fine, and
# declaring it here (rather than leaning on each machine's core.autocrlf) means
# no tool rewrites part of a file with the other ending.

* text=auto eol=lf

# The app's window, taskbar and tray icon.
*.ico binary
# The icon preview shown in the README.
*.png binary
# The EcoFlow session key table.
*.bin binary
